			    <div class="subSectionHeader">
				    
							
					
					<div class="right" style="width:380px;"><a href="signup.cfm" class="greenBtn">Subscribe to EnviroFlash</a> <a href="login.cfm" class="blueBtn">Manage Your Account</a></div>
				</div>				
				<br class="clear" />
	
				<div class="efSection">
					<span class="h1">Welcome to EnviroFlash!</span> Air quality affects how you live and breathe.
					Like the weather, it can change from day to day, or even hour to hour.
					Up-to-date information allows you to make decisions based on air quality
					forecasts. EnviroFlash comes to you through a partnership between the US
					EPA and your state or local air quality agency - notifying you about air
					quality so you don't have to go searching for it!
				</div>	
				
				<div class="efSection">
					<div class="mapPanel">
						<iframe
							id="airNowMap"
							title="AirNow Interactive Map"
							src="https://gispub.epa.gov/airnow/?tab=forecast&showgreencontours=true&forecastcontours=forecasttoday&xmin=-14300000&xmax=-7360000&ymin=2140000&ymax=6510000"
						></iframe>
						
						<a
							class="airNowMapLink"
							href="https://gispub.epa.gov/airnow/?tab=forecast&showgreencontours=true&forecastcontours=forecasttoday"
							target="_blank"
						></a>
					</div>
					<span style="font-style: italic"><span style="font-weight: bold">Note</span>: Not all agencies issuing forecasts through AirNow participate in the EnviroFlash programs</span>
				</div>
				<div class="efSection">
					EnviroFlash is sponsored by the EPA with support from state and local air quality agencies. 
					EnviroFlash provides air quality information such as forecasts and action day notifications via 
					email for your area of interest.
				</div>
				<div class="efSection">
					An <a href="signup.cfm">on-line subscription page</a> allows you to sign up, 
					edit your profile, or cancel the service. After you choose the type and frequency of 
					service you want, 
					EnviroFlash will be sent to your email or cell phone as specified.
				</div>
				
			
